  "solution": "BODMAS Rule:\n\n [IMAGE: https://cdn.repeatermock.com/tb/762cea937c30d1839625987840ff625e8cc3c9ba51a888c05e16bd4dbafd1fb9.png] \n\nGiven equation: 14 - 7 × 30 ÷ 10 + 4 = 54\n\nLet's check each option one by one\n\n1. + and -\n\nNow replacing the sign from left to right using BODMAS Rule, we get:\n\n⇒ 14 + 7 × __**30 ÷ **____**10**__ − 4 = 54\n\n⇒ 14 + __**7 × 3**__ − 4 = 54\n\n⇒ __**14 + 21**__ − 4 = 54\n\n⇒ __**35**____** − **____**4**__ = 54\n\n⇒ 31 ≠ 54\n\n⇒ LHS ≠ RHS\n\n2. × and -\n\nNow replacing the sign from left to right using BODMAS Rule, we get:\n\n⇒ 14 × 7 − __**30 ÷ 10**__ + 4 = 54\n\n⇒ __**14 × 7**__ − 3 + 4 = 54\n\n⇒ __**98**__ − 3 __**+ 4**__ = 54\n\n⇒ __**102**____** − 3**__ = 54\n\n⇒ 99 ≠ 54\n\n⇒ LHS ≠ RHS\n\n3. - and ÷\n\nNow replacing the sign from left to right using BODMAS Rule, we get:\n\n⇒ __**14 ÷ **____**7**__ × 30 − 10 + 4 = 54\n\n⇒ __**2**____** × **____**30**__ − 10 + 4 = 54\n\n⇒ __**60**__ − 10 __**+ **____**4**__ = 54\n\n⇒ __**64**____** − 10**__ = 54\n\n⇒ 54 = 54\n\n⇒ LHS = RHS\n\n4. ÷ and ×\n\nNow replacing the sign from left to right using BODMAS Rule, we get:\n\n⇒ 14 − __**7 ÷ **____**30**__ × 10 + 4 = 54\n\n⇒ 14 − __**0.23**____** × **____**10**__ + 4 = 54\n\n⇒ __**14**__ − 2.3 __**+ **____**4**__ = 54\n\n⇒ __**18 **____**− 2.3**__ = 54\n\n⇒ 15.67 ≠ 54\n\n⇒ LHS ≠ RHS\n\nHence, the correct answer is \"Option 3\".",
